As someone who lives in Southeast Asia, I found it difficult to find tournaments for my child to attend. In my work with [KeenTeam](/projects/keenteam), I started building a database of these. So, I decided to create a useful directory of it.

## Technologies used

- Ruby on Rails web application
- SQLite databases
- Deploys with Docker
